# MDIC answers nothing for 10 ms after CTRL.RST, which is the settle the
# I219 datasheet requires in section 9.2. Off by default so every existing
# green keeps the floor it was measured against.
#
# -e1000-phy-link is on for the same reason it is on in e1000-phy: without
# it STATUS.LU follows CTRL.SLU alone, and the link reading would pass on a
# bring-up that never reached the PHY at all. The two together are what
# reproduce the metal symptom on the desk.
-e1000-mdio-window
-e1000-phy-link
